sitions GPS ne sont jamais envoyés.\u0001• The meal photo and your allergies are sent for the analysis.\n• For recommendations: age, sex, weight, height, activity, goal, habits, allergies and today's meals. For the coach, also: your numbers from the last 7 days (scores, calories, steps, workouts, outings, weight trend) and your meal plan. This is health data.\n• It goes through the Lifoody server (hosted by Cloudflare), which immediately forwards it to Google without storing it: no photo, message or answer is kept there. It only keeps usage counters, tied to a random identifier.\n• Google processes it to answer and may keep it temporarily (for example to detect abuse), sometimes outside the EU. With the paid Gemini API tier used by Lifoody, Google doesn't use it to improve its products.\n• AI answers are estimates and may be wrong: double-check them.\n• Your first name, your sleep and your GPS locations are never sent.\u0002🏃 Sport\u0001🏃 Workout"

